// 계량기 촬영과 OCR 보정 및 수동 입력 흐름을 제공하는 화면
import React, { useEffect, useState } from 'react'
import BG from '../mockData.js'
import { cameraPreviewController, getPhoto, isPhotoCancelled } from '../camera.js'
import { scanMeter, saveReading, updateTodayReading, ApiError } from '../api.js'
import { persistReading } from '../readingSave.js'
import { formatPreviousReading } from '../readingContext.js'
import { BGC, MIcon, Card, PrimaryBtn, GhostBtn, SectionLabel, WaterBar, Chip } from './ui.jsx'

function MeterFace({ digits, scale = 1 }) {
  return (
    <div style={{
      width: 220 * scale, height: 220 * scale, borderRadius: '50%', background: '#26415C',
      display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center',
      boxShadow: 'inset 0 0 0 7px #18293B, 0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,0.35)', flexShrink: 0,
    }}>
      <div style={{
        width: 178 * scale, height: 178 * scale, borderRadius: '50%', background: '#F2F6F9',
        display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 9 * scale,
      }}>
        <div style={{ fontSize: 9.5 * scale, letterSpacing: 2.5, color: '#7A8FA3', fontWeight: 700 }}>SMART METER</div>
        <div style={{ display: 'flex', gap: 2.5 * scale }}>
          {digits.split('').map((d, i) => (
            <div key={i} style={{
              width: 19 * scale, height: 29 * scale, borderRadius: 4 * scale,
              background: i < 4 ? '#1E2D3D' : '#B8443A', color: '#fff',
              fontFamily: 'Jua', fontSize: 19 * scale,
              display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center',
            }}>{d}</div>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div style={{ fontSize: 10.5 * scale, color: '#7A8FA3', fontWeight: 700 }}>
          m³ <span style={{ color: '#B8443A' }}>· 빨간 칸은 L</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}

function DialCol({ val, red, flagged, onChange }) {
  const c = red ? '#B8443A' : BGC.ink;
  return (
    <div style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', gap: 4 }}>
      <button className="dial-btn press" onClick={() => onChange((val + 1) % 10)} aria-label="올리기">
        <MIcon name="keyboard_arrow_up" size={20} color={BGC.sub}></MIcon>
      </button>
      <div style={{
        position: 'relative', width: 41, borderRadius: 12, background: '#fff', textAlign: 'center', padding: '3px 0',
        border: flagged ? '2.5px solid #F5A623' : `2px solid ${red ? '#EBC6C2' : BGC.line}`,
        boxShadow: flagged ? '0 0 0 4px #FFF1CF' : 'none',
      }}>
        <div className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#C3D5E2', lineHeight: '15px' }}>{(val + 9) % 10}</div>
        <div className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 27, color: c, lineHeight: '30px' }}>{val}</div>
        <div className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#C3D5E2', lineHeight: '15px' }}>{(val + 1) % 10}</div>
        {flagged && (
          <div style={{
            position: 'absolute', top: -9, right: -9, width: 18, height: 18, borderRadius: '50%',
            background: '#F5A623', color: '#fff', fontSize: 11, fontWeight: 800,
            display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center',
          }}>?</div>
        )}
      </div>
      <button className="dial-btn press" onClick={() => onChange((val + 9) % 10)} aria-label="내리기">
        <MIcon name="keyboard_arrow_down" size={20} color={BGC.sub}></MIcon>
      </button>
    </div>
  );
}

function CameraFlow({ scenario, goal, startStep, todayReading, previousReading, onClose, onReadingSaved, onDone }) {
  const sc = BG.SCENARIOS[scenario];
  const initialReading = todayReading
    ? Math.round(todayReading.reading_m3 * 1000).toString().padStart(7, '0').slice(-7)
    : sc.digits;
  const [step, setStep] = useState(startStep || 'view'); // view → scan → confirm → done
  const [digits, setDigits] = useState(initialReading.split('').map(Number));
  const [confidence, setConfidence] = useState(null);
  const [saveResult, setSaveResult] = useState(null);
  const [error, setError] = useState('');
  const [saving, setSaving] = useState(false);
  const [baselinePrompt, setBaselinePrompt] = useState(null);
  const [previewStarted, setPreviewStarted] = useState(false);
  const [flashSupported, setFlashSupported] = useState(false);
  const [flashOn, setFlashOn] = useState(false);
  const [capturing, setCapturing] = useState(false);
  const [scanFile, setScanFile] = useState(null);
  const [scanPreviewUrl, setScanPreviewUrl] = useState('');
  const previousReadingText = formatPreviousReading(previousReading);
  const flaggedIdx = 4;
  const nativePreview = cameraPreviewController.isAvailable();

  useEffect(() => {
    setDigits(initialReading.split('').map(Number));
    setBaselinePrompt(null);
  }, [scenario, initialReading]);

  useEffect(() => {
    if (step !== 'view' || !nativePreview) return undefined;

    let active = true;
    const startTimer = window.setTimeout(async () => {
      try {
        const result = await cameraPreviewController.start('meter-camera-preview');
        if (!active) {
          await cameraPreviewController.stop();
          return;
        }
        setPreviewStarted(result.started);
        setFlashSupported(result.flashSupported);
        if (result.started) document.body.classList.add('camera-preview-active');
      } catch {
        if (active) setError('카메라를 시작하지 못했습니다. 권한을 확인하거나 사진을 선택해주세요.');
      }
    }, 0);

    return () => {
      active = false;
      window.clearTimeout(startTimer);
      document.body.classList.remove('camera-preview-active');
      void cameraPreviewController.stop();
    };
  }, [step, nativePreview]);

  useEffect(() => () => {
    if (scanPreviewUrl) URL.revokeObjectURL(scanPreviewUrl);
  }, [scanPreviewUrl]);

  const reading = parseInt(digits.join(''), 10);
  const readingM3 = reading / 1000;
  const usage = saveResult?.usage_m3 == null ? reading - BG.METER_YESTERDAY : Math.round(saveResult.usage_m3 * 1000);
  const valid = reading > 0;
  const e = BG.energyOf(Math.max(0, usage));
  const saved = goal - usage;
  const reward = valid ? (saved >= 0 ? 12 : 2) : 0;
  const savedEnergy = Math.abs(saved) * BG.PER_LITER_KWH;

  const clearScanFile = () => {
    setScanFile(null);
    setScanPreviewUrl('');
  };

  const rememberScanFile = (file) => {
    setScanFile(file);
    setScanPreviewUrl(URL.createObjectURL(file));
  };

  const analyzeFile = async (file) => {
    setError('');
    setStep('scan');
    try {
      const scan = await scanMeter(file);
      if (!scan.success) {
        clearScanFile();
        setConfidence(null);
        setStep('manual');
        return;
      }
      const nextDigits = Math.round(scan.reading_m3 * 1000).toString().padStart(7, '0').slice(-7);
      clearScanFile();
      setDigits(nextDigits.split('').map(Number));
      setConfidence(scan.confidence);
      setStep('confirm');
    } catch (caught) {
      setError(caught?.name === 'TimeoutError'
        ? '사진 인식 시간이 초과되었습니다.'
        : '서버에 연결할 수 없습니다. 다시 시도해주세요.');
      setStep('scan-error');
    }
  };

  const retryScan = () => {
    if (scanFile) void analyzeFile(scanFile);
  };

  const capture = async (source) => {
    setError('');
    setBaselinePrompt(null);
    let file;
    try {
      if (source === 'camera' && nativePreview) {
        setCapturing(true);
        file = await cameraPreviewController.capture();
        await cameraPreviewController.stop();
        document.body.classList.remove('camera-preview-active');
        setPreviewStarted(false);
        setFlashSupported(false);
        setFlashOn(false);
      } else {
        file = await getPhoto(source);
      }
    } catch (caught) {
      setStep('view');
      if (isPhotoCancelled(caught)) {
        return;
      }
      setError('사진을 불러오지 못했습니다. 다시 시도해주세요.');
      return;
    } finally {
      setCapturing(false);
    }

    rememberScanFile(file);
    await analyzeFile(file);
  };

  const toggleFlash = async () => {
    if (!previewStarted || !flashSupported || capturing) return;
    setError('');
    try {
      const result = await cameraPreviewController.toggleFlash();
      setFlashOn(result.flashOn);
    } catch {
      setError('플래시를 전환하지 못했습니다.');
    }
  };

  const confirmReading = async (inputMode) => {
    setError('');
    setBaselinePrompt(null);
    setSaving(true);
    try {
      const { result } = await persistReading({
        todayReading,
        payload: {
          reading_m3: readingM3,
          confidence: inputMode === 'auto' ? confidence : null,
          input_mode: inputMode,
        },
        saveReading,
        updateTodayReading,
      });
      onReadingSaved(result);
      setSaveResult(result);
      setStep('done');
    } catch (caught) {
      if (caught instanceof ApiError && caught.status === 422) {
        setError('검침값이 이전 기록보다 작거나 같습니다. 값을 확인해주세요.');
        setBaselinePrompt({
          step: 'offer',
          reading_m3: readingM3,
          confidence: inputMode === 'auto' ? confidence : null,
          input_mode: inputMode,
        });
      } else {
        setError('저장에 실패했습니다. 다시 시도해주세요.');
      }
    } finally {
      setSaving(false);
    }
  };

  const confirmBaseline = async () => {
    setError('');
    setSaving(true);
    try {
      const { result } = await persistReading({
        todayReading,
        payload: {
          reading_m3: baselinePrompt.reading_m3,
          confidence: baselinePrompt.confidence,
          input_mode: baselinePrompt.input_mode,
          reset_baseline: true,
        },
        saveReading,
        updateTodayReading,
      });
      onReadingSaved(result);
      setSaveResult(result);
      setBaselinePrompt(null);
      setStep('done');
    } catch {
      setError('저장에 실패했습니다. 다시 시도해주세요.');
    } finally {
      setSaving(false);
    }
  };

  const changeDigit = (index, value) => {
    if (saving) return;
    setDigits(digits.map((digit, i) => (i === index ? value : digit)));
    setError('');
    setBaselinePrompt(null);
  };

  const returnToView = () => {
    if (saving) return;
    setError('');
    setBaselinePrompt(null);
    clearScanFile();
    setStep('view');
  };

  const baselinePromptCard = () => {
    if (baselinePrompt?.step === 'offer') {
      return (
        <GhostBtn icon="swap_horiz" onClick={() => setBaselinePrompt({ ...baselinePrompt, step: 'confirm' })} style={{ marginTop: 10 }}>계량기를 교체했어요</GhostBtn>
      );
    }
    if (baselinePrompt?.step !== 'confirm') return null;
    return (
      <Card style={{ marginTop: 12, background: '#FFF6D8', borderColor: '#F3DF9B' }}>
        <div className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 18, color: BGC.ink }}>새 계량기 기준값으로 저장할까요?</div>
        <div style={{ color: BGC.sub, fontSize: 13.5, lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 7 }}>
          기존 기록은 그대로 보관하고, 교체 직전 구간은 사용량을 계산하지 않아요.
        </div>
        <div style={{ display: 'flex', gap: 10, marginTop: 12 }}>
          <GhostBtn onClick={() => { if (saving) return; setBaselinePrompt(null); setError(''); }} style={{ flex: 1 }}>취소</GhostBtn>
          <PrimaryBtn icon="check" onClick={confirmBaseline} disabled={saving} style={{ flex: 1.4 }}>
            {saving ? '저장 중…' : '기준값으로 저장'}
          </PrimaryBtn>
        </div>
      </Card>
    );
  };

  const darkTop = (title) => (
    <div style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', padding: '6px 12px', background: nativePreview ? 'rgba(14,27,38,0.72)' : 'transparent' }}>
      <button className="press" onClick={onClose} style={{ background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.12)', border: 'none', borderRadius: 12, width: 38, height: 38, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', cursor: 'pointer' }}>
        <MIcon name="close" size={21} color="#fff"></MIcon>
      </button>
      <div className="jua" style={{ flex: 1, textAlign: 'center', fontSize: 17, color: '#fff' }}>{title}</div>
      <button className="press" onClick={toggleFlash} disabled={!previewStarted || !flashSupported || capturing} aria-label={flashOn ? '플래시 끄기' : '플래시 켜기'} style={{ background: flashOn ? '#F5C451' : 'rgba(255,255,255,0.12)', border: 'none', borderRadius: 12, width: 38, height: 38, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', cursor: flashSupported ? 'pointer' : 'default', opacity: nativePreview && flashSupported ? 1 : 0.42 }}>
        <MIcon name={flashOn ? 'flash_on' : 'flash_off'} size={20} color={flashOn ? '#44320A' : '#fff'} fill={flashOn ? 1 : 0}></MIcon>
      </button>
    </div>
  );

  // ── 1) 뷰파인더 + 2) 스캔 ──
  if (step === 'view' || step === 'scan' || step === 'scan-error') {
    const scanning = step === 'scan';
    const scanFailed = step === 'scan-error';
    return (
        <div id="meter-camera-preview" data-screen-label={scanning ? '촬영-인식중' : '촬영-뷰파인더'} style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: 0, height: '100%', background: nativePreview && previewStarted && !scanning ? 'transparent' : '#0E1B26', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          {darkTop('계량기 촬영')}
          <div style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
            <div style={{ position: 'relative', width: nativePreview ? 'min(78vw, 310px)' : 'auto', height: nativePreview ? 'min(52vh, 360px)' : 'auto', border: '2.5px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.45)', borderRadius: 28, padding: nativePreview ? 0 : 30, overflow: 'hidden' }}>
              {scanPreviewUrl
                ? <img src={scanPreviewUrl} alt="인식할 계량기 사진" style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'contain', display: 'block' }}></img>
                : !nativePreview && <MeterFace digits={sc.digits}></MeterFace>}
              {scanning && <div className="scanline"></div>}
            </div>
            {scanning ? (
              <div style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="방울이" className="bob" style={{ height: 52 }}></img>
                <div style={{ color: '#fff', fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 700 }}>방울이가 숫자를 읽고 있어요…</div>
              </div>
            ) : scanFailed ? (
              <div style={{ color: '#FFB7AF', fontSize: 14.5, fontWeight: 700 }}>사진을 인식하지 못했어요.</div>
            ) : (
              <div style={{ color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.75)', fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 600 }}>숫자판이 테두리 안에 들어오게 맞춰주세요</div>
            )}
          </div>
          <div style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, padding: '12px 0 22px', background: nativePreview ? 'rgba(14,27,38,0.72)' : 'transparent' }}>
            {step === 'view' && (
              <button className="press" onClick={() => { setError(''); setBaselinePrompt(null); setStep('manual'); }} style={{
                background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.12)', border: '1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3)', borderRadius: 99,
                padding: '9px 18px', cursor: 'pointer', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', gap: 7,
                color: '#fff', fontFamily: 'Jua', fontSize: 14,
              }}>
                <MIcon name="keyboard" size={18} color="#fff"></MIcon>
                사진 없이 직접 입력하기
              </button>
            )}
            {step === 'view' && (
              <div style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', gap: 44 }}>
                <button className="press" onClick={() => capture('photos')} style={{ background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.12)', border: 'none', borderRadius: 16, width: 50, height: 50, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', cursor: 'pointer' }}>
                  <MIcon name="image" size={24} color="#fff" fill={0}></MIcon>
                </button>
                <button className="press" onClick={() => capture('camera')} disabled={capturing || (nativePreview && !previewStarted)} aria-label="촬영" style={{
                  width: 78, height: 78, borderRadius: '50%', cursor: capturing ? 'default' : 'pointer', opacity: nativePreview && !previewStarted ? 0.55 : 1,
                  background: '#fff', border: '5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35)', backgroundClip: 'padding-box',
                }}></button>
                <div style={{ width: 50 }}></div>
              </div>
            )}
            {scanFailed && (
              <div style={{ display: 'flex', gap: 10 }}>
                <GhostBtn icon="refresh" onClick={retryScan}>같은 사진 다시 시도</GhostBtn>
                <GhostBtn icon="keyboard" onClick={() => { clearScanFile(); setError(''); setStep('manual'); }}>직접 입력</GhostBtn>
              </div>
            )}
            <div style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', gap: 6, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.55)', fontSize: 12 }}>
              <MIcon name="lock" size={14} color="rgba(255,255,255,0.55)"></MIcon>
              사진은 검침 숫자 인식을 위해 서버로 전송돼요
            </div>
            {error && <div role="alert" style={{ color: '#FFB7AF', fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 700 }}>{error}</div>}
          </div>
        </div>
);
  }

  // ── 직접 입력 (사진 없이) ──
  if (step === 'manual') {
    return (
        <div data-screen-label="검침 숫자 입력하기" className="fade-up" style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: 0, overflowY: 'auto', padding: '0 18px 22px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
          <div style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', padding: '8px 0' }}>
            <button className="press" onClick={returnToView} style={{ background: '#fff', border: `1.5px solid ${BGC.line}`, borderRadius: 12, width: 38, height: 38, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', cursor: 'pointer' }}>
              <MIcon name="arrow_back" size={20} color={BGC.ink}></MIcon>
            </button>
            <div className="jua" style={{ flex: 1, textAlign: 'center', fontSize: 18, color: BGC.ink }}>검침 숫자 입력하기</div>
            <div style={{ width: 38 }}></div>
          </div>

          <div style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', paddingBottom: 20 }}>
          <Card style={{ marginTop: 0 }}>
            <SectionLabel icon="tune">검침 숫자를 입력하세요</SectionLabel>
            <div style={{ margin: '-2px 0 12px', textAlign: 'center', fontSize: 12.5, fontWeight: 700, color: BGC.sub }}>
              {previousReadingText}
            </div>
            <div style={{ display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
              {digits.map((d, i) => (
                <React.Fragment key={i}>
                  {i === 4 && <div className="jua" style={{ alignSelf: 'center', fontSize: 22, color: BGC.sub }}>.</div>}
                  <DialCol val={d} red={i >= 4} flagged={false} onChange={(v) => changeDigit(i, v)}></DialCol>
                </React.Fragment>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div style={{
              marginTop: 14, borderRadius: 14, padding: '12px 14px', textAlign: 'center',
              background: valid ? '#EAF5FD' : '#FBEAE8',
            }}>
              {valid ? (
                <span style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 700, color: BGC.ink }}>
                  입력한 검침값 <span className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 19, color: BGC.skyDeep }}>{readingM3.toFixed(3)} ㎥</span>
                </span>
              ) : (
                <span style={{ fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 700, color: BGC.red }}>검침값을 입력해 주세요</span>
              )}
            </div>
          </Card>

          {error && <div role="alert" style={{ color: BGC.red, fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 700, marginTop: 12, textAlign: 'center' }}>{error}</div>}
          {baselinePromptCard()}
          <PrimaryBtn icon="check" onClick={() => valid && confirmReading('manual')} disabled={!valid || saving} style={{ marginTop: 14 }}>{saving ? '저장 중…' : '이 값으로 확정'}</PrimaryBtn>
          </div>
        </div>
);
  }

  // ── 3) 다이얼 보정 ──
  if (step === 'confirm') {
    return (
        <div data-screen-label="OCR 다이얼 보정" className="fade-up" style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: 0, overflowY: 'auto', padding: '0 18px 22px' }}>
          <div style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', padding: '8px 0' }}>
            <button className="press" onClick={returnToView} style={{ background: '#fff', border: `1.5px solid ${BGC.line}`, borderRadius: 12, width: 38, height: 38, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center', cursor: 'pointer' }}>
              <MIcon name="arrow_back" size={20} color={BGC.ink}></MIcon>
            </button>
            <div className="jua" style={{ flex: 1, textAlign: 'center', fontSize: 18, color: BGC.ink }}>인식 결과 확인</div>
            <div style={{ width: 38 }}></div>
          </div>

          <div style={{ display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 8, marginBottom: 14 }}>
            <Chip icon="document_scanner" color={BGC.skyDeep}>OCR 신뢰도 {Math.round((confidence || 0) * 100)}%</Chip>
            <Chip icon="touch_app" color="#C26A1B" bg="#FDEFD9">노란 칸만 확인해 주세요</Chip>
          </div>

          <Card pad={16} style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, background: '#1B2F44', border: 'none' }}>
            <MeterFace digits={digits.join('')} scale={0.52}></MeterFace>
            <div style={{ color: '#fff' }}>
              <div style={{ fontSize: 12, opacity: 0.65, fontWeight: 700 }}>방금 찍은 계량기</div>
              <div className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 21, marginTop: 4 }}>
                {digits.slice(0, 4).join('')}<span style={{ color: '#FF9C92' }}>.{digits.slice(4).join('')}</span> ㎥
              </div>
              <div style={{ fontSize: 11.5, opacity: 0.65, marginTop: 4 }}>{previousReadingText}</div>
            </div>
          </Card>

          <Card style={{ marginTop: 12 }}>
            <SectionLabel icon="tune">다이얼로 맞춰주세요</SectionLabel>
            <div style={{ display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
              {digits.map((d, i) => (
                <React.Fragment key={i}>
                  {i === 4 && <div className="jua" style={{ alignSelf: 'center', fontSize: 22, color: BGC.sub }}>.</div>}
                  <DialCol val={d} red={i >= 4} flagged={i === flaggedIdx} onChange={(v) => changeDigit(i, v)}></DialCol>
                </React.Fragment>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div style={{
              marginTop: 14, borderRadius: 14, padding: '12px 14px', textAlign: 'center',
              background: valid ? '#EAF5FD' : '#FBEAE8',
            }}>
              {valid ? (
                <span style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 700, color: BGC.ink }}>
                  인식한 검침값 <span className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 19, color: BGC.skyDeep }}>{readingM3.toFixed(3)} ㎥</span>
                </span>
              ) : (
                <span style={{ fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 700, color: BGC.red }}>검침값을 입력해 주세요</span>
              )}
            </div>
          </Card>

          <div style={{ display: 'flex', gap: 10, marginTop: 14 }}>
            <GhostBtn icon="photo_camera" onClick={returnToView} style={{ flex: 1 }}>다시 찍기</GhostBtn>
            <PrimaryBtn icon="check" onClick={() => valid && confirmReading('auto')} disabled={!valid || saving} style={{ flex: 1.4 }}>{saving ? '저장 중…' : '이 값으로 확정'}</PrimaryBtn>
          </div>
          {error && <div role="alert" style={{ color: BGC.red, fontSize: 13.5, fontWeight: 700, marginTop: 12, textAlign: 'center' }}>{error}</div>}
          {baselinePromptCard()}
          <div style={{ display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 6, marginTop: 12, color: BGC.sub, fontSize: 11.5 }}>
            <MIcon name="school" size={14} color={BGC.sub}></MIcon>
            확정한 값은 검침 기록으로 저장돼요
          </div>
        </div>
);
  }

  if (step === 'done' && saveResult?.baseline_reset) {
    return (
      <div data-screen-label="계량기 교체 기준값 저장 완료" className="fade-up" style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: 0, padding: '24px 20px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Card style={{ textAlign: 'center' }}>
          <MIcon name="check_circle" size={52} color="#2C8A60"></MIcon>
          <div className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 25, color: BGC.ink, marginTop: 12 }}>새 계량기 기준값을 저장했어요</div>
          <div style={{ color: BGC.sub, fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>다음 검침부터 이 값을 기준으로 계산을 시작할게요.</div>
          <div className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 23, color: BGC.skyDeep, marginTop: 18 }}>{saveResult.reading_m3.toFixed(3)} ㎥</div>
        </Card>
        <PrimaryBtn icon="home" onClick={() => onDone({ firstReading: false, usage: 0, reward: 0, updated: saveResult.updated })} style={{ marginTop: 14 }}>방울이에게 가기</PrimaryBtn>
      </div>
    );
  }

  if (step === 'done' && saveResult?.updated) {
    return (
      <div data-screen-label="오늘 검침 수정 완료" className="fade-up" style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: 0, padding: '24px 20px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Card style={{ textAlign: 'center' }}>
          <MIcon name="check_circle" size={52} color="#2C8A60"></MIcon>
          <div className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 25, color: BGC.ink, marginTop: 12 }}>오늘 검침값을 수정했어요</div>
          <div style={{ color: BGC.sub, fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>새 기록을 추가하지 않고 오늘 기록만 바꿨어요.</div>
          <div className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 23, color: BGC.skyDeep, marginTop: 18 }}>{saveResult.reading_m3.toFixed(3)} ㎥</div>
        </Card>
        <PrimaryBtn icon="home" onClick={() => onDone({ firstReading: false, usage: 0, reward: 0, updated: true })} style={{ marginTop: 14 }}>방울이에게 가기</PrimaryBtn>
      </div>
    );
  }

  if (step === 'done' && saveResult?.first_reading) {
    return (
      <div data-screen-label="첫 검침 저장 완료" className="fade-up" style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: 0, padding: '24px 20px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Card style={{ textAlign: 'center' }}>
          <MIcon name="check_circle" size={52} color="#2C8A60"></MIcon>
          <div className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 25, color: BGC.ink, marginTop: 12 }}>첫 검침값을 저장했어요!</div>
          <div style={{ color: BGC.sub, fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>다음 검침부터 사용량·목표 달성·요금·에너지 리포트를 확인할 수 있어요.</div>
          <div className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 23, color: BGC.skyDeep, marginTop: 18 }}>{saveResult.reading_m3.toFixed(3)} ㎥</div>
        </Card>
        <PrimaryBtn icon="home" onClick={() => onDone({ firstReading: true, usage: 0, reward: 0, updated: saveResult.updated })} style={{ marginTop: 14 }}>방울이에게 가기</PrimaryBtn>
      </div>
    );
  }

  // ── 4) 기록 완료 ──
  return (
      <div data-screen-label="기록 완료" className="fade-up" style={{ flex: 1, minHeight: 0, overflowY: 'auto', padding: '10px 20px 24px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <div style={{ textAlign: 'center', marginTop: 6 }}>
          <div className="pop" style={{ display: 'inline-flex', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, background: '#FFF6D8', border: '1.5px solid #F3DF9B', borderRadius: 99, padding: '8px 18px' }}>
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="나무코인" style={{ width: 26, height: 26 }}></img>
            <span className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8A6A14' }}>나무코인 +{reward}</span>
          </div>
          <div className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 28, color: BGC.ink, marginTop: 14 }}>오늘 기록 완료!</div>
          <img src={saved >= 0 ? 'data:image/png;base64,' : 'data:image/png;base64,'} alt="방울이" className="bob" style={{ height: 130, marginTop: 10 }}></img>
        </div>

        <Card style={{ marginTop: 12 }}>
          {saveResult?.bill && (
            <div style={{ display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginBottom: 12, paddingBottom: 12, borderBottom: `1.5px dashed ${BGC.line}` }}>
              <span style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 700, color: BGC.sub }}>이번 달 예상 요금</span>
              <span className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 22, color: BGC.ink }}>{saveResult.bill.total.toLocaleString()}원</span>
            </div>
          )}
          <div style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 6 }}>
            <span className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 34, color: BGC.skyDeep }}>{usage.toLocaleString()}L</span>
            <span style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 700, color: BGC.sub }}>/ 목표 {goal}L</span>
            <div style={{ flex: 1 }}></div>
            {saved >= 0
              ? <Chip icon="check_circle" color="#2C8A60" bg="#E8F6EF">{saved}L 절약</Chip>
              : <Chip icon="error" color="#C26A1B" bg="#FDEFD9">{-saved}L 초과</Chip>}
          </div>
          <div style={{ margin: '10px 0 14px' }}>
            <WaterBar value={usage} goal={goal}></WaterBar>
          </div>
          {[['local_fire_department', '#C26A1B', '온수 가열', e.hot], ['water_drop', BGC.skyDeep, '상수도 공급', e.supply], ['waves', '#2C8A60', '하수 처리', e.sewage]].map(([ic, c, label, v]) => (
            <div key={label} style={{ display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, padding: '5px 0', fontSize: 13.5, color: BGC.ink, fontWeight: 600 }}>
              <MIcon name={ic} size={17} color={c}></MIcon>
              <span style={{ flex: 1 }}>{label}</span>
              <span className="jua" style={{ fontSize: 15 }}>{BG.fmt1(v)} kWh</span>
            </div>
          ))}
          <div style={{ borderTop: `1.5px dashed ${BGC.line}`, marginTop: 6, paddingTop: 10, display: 'flex', gap: 7 }}>
            <Chip icon="bolt" color="#B8860B" bg="#FFF6D8">총 {BG.fmt1(e.total)}kWh</Chip>
            <Chip icon="co2" color="#2C8A60" bg="#E8F6EF">CO₂ {BG.fmt1(e.co2)}kg</Chip>
          </div>
        </Card>

        <div style={{ marginTop: 12, background: '#FFF6D8', border: '1.5px solid #F3DF9B', borderRadius: 18, padding: '13px 16px', fontSize: 13.5, lineHeight: 1.55, color: '#6B5410', fontWeight: 600 }}>
          {saved >= 0
            ? <span>물 {saved}L를 아낀 만큼 <b>온수 데우는 에너지 약 {BG.fmt1(savedEnergy)}kWh</b>도 함께 절약했어요!</span>
            : <span>내일은 온수 샤워를 1분만 줄여볼까요? 물 12L와 에너지 0.74kWh를 같이 아낄 수 있어요!</span>}
        </div>

        <div style={{ flex: 1 }}></div>
        <PrimaryBtn icon="home" onClick={() => onDone({ firstReading: false, usage, reward, updated: saveResult.updated })} style={{ marginTop: 14 }}>방울이에게 가기</PrimaryBtn>
      </div>
);
}

export default CameraFlow
